+\section{Saved-Prediction Check of the Core F2 Visual Term}
+The 25 November arithmetic audit checks 4,530 unique actions, their 509 failure labels, fold assignments and separation of the 148 recording groups. Section~1B's held-out branch columns match Section~2's reused inputs; the sensor column also matches the separately saved statistical control. The original Section~1 visual prediction file is unavailable locally, so parity does not extend to a replay of that file or of training. The inspected fitting source and saved metadata order the columns as visual, then sensor.
+
+All visual coefficients are positive (3.099--4.063), as are all sensor coefficients (6.218--6.709). Reconstructing F2 from them differs from the saved probabilities by at most $2.22\times10^{-16}$. Independently calculated threshold-group AP and positive--negative ordering changes agree with the library metrics. Omitting the visual term preserves each fold's sensor AP and AUROC; Table~\ref{tab:f2-fold-audit} gives the full-model changes.
